## 【运行时执行】

### initializeCudaContext
```
initializeCudaContext()

用途: 懒初始化 CUDA context（如果不存在）
算法:
    cuCtxGetCurrent(&pctx)
    if pctx == null:
        lock(getFreeMutex())
        cudaFree(nullptr)  # 触发 context 创建
```

### launch_jitted_pwise_function
```
@host
launch_jitted_pwise_function(
    function: NvrtcFunction,
    args: void* const[],
    nBlocks: dim3,
    kBlockSize: dim3,
    smem: int = 0
)

用途: 在当前 stream 上启动已编译的 kernel
算法:
    initializeCudaContext()
    stream = getCurrentCUDAStream()
    cuLaunchKernel(
        function.function,
        nBlocks.x, nBlocks.y, nBlocks.z,
        kBlockSize.x, kBlockSize.y, kBlockSize.z,
        smem,
        stream,
        args,
        nullptr
    )
```

